          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem eta2_eq_log {x : ℝ} (hx : 0 < x) {m n : ℝ} (hm : 0 < m) (hn : 0 < n) :\n    (max (x / (2 * m)) n < min (x / m) (2 * n) →\n      eta2 (m * n / x) = 4 * (Real.log (min (x / m) (2 * n)) - Real.log (max (x / (2 * m)) n))) ∧\n    (min (x / m) (2 * n) ≤ max (x / (2 * m)) n → eta2 (m * n / x) = 0) :=",
